        "body": "This selected original protocol 1.0.0 run evaluates three NQ setups during 20:00–00:00 New York time: A, a confirmed reversal toward prior RTH POC after a VAH/VAL excursion; B, developing Asia value-boundary break and retest; C, a fade at a pre-touch selected HVN. The publication emphasizes validation 2024–2025 with a fixed thirty-minute horizon.",
